Host drop directory for the 9vm Gemini page.

The guest mounts this directory at /n/host (9vm is started with the
inferno tree as its root), so the drop directory appears as
/n/host/dis.  Copy a .dis file here:

	cp hello.dis inferno/dis/

The page lists every .dis file here and offers it for download at
/dis/NAME.  To run one inside the guest, append to gem/ctl:

	echo install hello.dis >> gem/ctl

gemserve copies it into /dislocal, which init binds after the
read-only /dis, so the program then runs as /dis/hello.dis.
